      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for item 45 the following item: Monthly Employer’s Employee’s Wages Contribution Contribution RM70.85 “45. When wages exceed RM4,000 but not RM4,100 (iii) by inserting after item 45 the following items: Monthly Employer’s Employee’s Wages Contribution Contribution “46. When RM72.65 wages exceed RM4,100 but not RM4,200 47. When RM74.35 wages exceed RM4,200 but not RM4,300 Monthly Employer’s Employee’s Total Wages Contribution Contribution 48. When RM76.15 RM21.75 RM97.90 wages exceed RM4,300 but not RM4,400 49. When RM77.85 RM22.25 RM100.10 wages exceed RM4,400 but not RM4,500 50. When RM79.65 RM22.75 RM102.40 wages exceed RM4,500 but not RM4,600 51. When RM81.35 RM23.25 RM104.60 wages exceed RM4,600 but not RM4,700 52. When RM83.15 RM23.75 RM106.90 wages exceed RM4,700 but not RM4,800 53. When RM84.85 RM24.25 RM109.10 wages exceed RM4,800 but not RM4,900 54. When RM86.65 RM24.75 RM111.40 wages exceed RM4,900 but not RM5,000 55. When RM86.65 RM24.75 RM111.40”; and wages exceed RM5,000"
      }
    },
    {
